    "Active chats use the installed CLI's advertised `--resume <id>` command, with `--continue` only when the session working directory is known. Archived chats remain browsable and searchable, but Qwen cannot resume them in place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Active chats use the installed CLI's advertised `--resume <id>` command, with `--continue` only when the session working directory is known. Archived chats remain browsable and searchable, but Qwen cannot resume them in place."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "活跃对话使用已安装 CLI 提供的 `--resume <id>` 命令；只有在会话工作目录已知时才使用 `--continue`。已归档的对话仍可浏览和搜索，但 Qwen 无法在原位置继续它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
