    },
    "Agent Sessions detected %lld new crash reports from a prior run. You can email the report directly or export it and open a GitHub issue: https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions/issues/new": {
      "comment": "Crash recovery explanation. The count needs plural variants; the product name and URL remain verbatim.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Agent Sessions detected %lld new crash report from a prior run. You can email the report directly or export it and open a GitHub issue: https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions/issues/new"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Agent Sessions detected %lld new crash reports from a prior run. You can email the report directly or export it and open a GitHub issue: https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions/issues/new"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Agent Sessions 检测到上次运行产生的%lld份新崩溃报告。你可以直接通过电子邮件发送报告，也可以将其导出并创建 GitHub Issue：https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions/issues/new"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Agent Sessions 检测到上次运行产生的%lld份新崩溃报告。你可以直接通过电子邮件发送报告，也可以将其导出并创建 GitHub Issue：https://github.com/jazzyalex/agent-sessions/issues/new"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent Sessions is local-first, independent, and actively maintained. A GitHub star or sponsorship keeps it going.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent Sessions is local-first, independent, and actively maintained. A GitHub star or sponsorship keeps it going."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent Sessions 坚持本地优先、独立开发并持续维护。为项目加 GitHub Star 或提供赞助，都能帮助它继续发展。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent Sessions is otherwise read-only. Enabling this lets it modify Claude Desktop's session metadata to un-archive a session. Best done while Claude Desktop is quit, since Claude may overwrite the change. Your transcripts are never altered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent Sessions is otherwise read-only. Enabling this lets it modify Claude Desktop's session metadata to un-archive a session. Best done while Claude Desktop is quit, since Claude may overwrite the change. Your transcripts are never altered."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除此功能外，Agent Sessions 只执行读取操作。启用此功能后，它可以修改 Claude Desktop 的会话元数据，以取消归档会话。最好在 Claude Desktop 已退出时操作，因为 Claude 可能会覆盖此更改。你的对话记录绝不会被修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent Sessions now prioritizes Unified and Quota Meter responsiveness.\nAnalytics indexing starts only when you open Analytics.": {
      "comment": "Informational alert body. Keep the two sentences and line break together.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent Sessions now prioritizes Unified and Quota Meter responsiveness.\nAnalytics indexing starts only when you open Analytics."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent Sessions 现在会优先保证统一视图和额度监视器的响应速度。\n仅当你打开“分析”时，才会开始建立分析索引。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent Sessions will only import files that match Droid’s stream-json schema to avoid false positives.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent Sessions will only import files that match Droid’s stream-json schema to avoid false positives."
