    "Analytics ran on a hand-written list of agents, and Cursor and OpenClaw were never on it — their sessions showed up everywhere else but contributed to no total, chart or project breakdown. Every agent you enable is now counted, and Cursor gets its own entry in the agent picker.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Analytics ran on a hand-written list of agents, and Cursor and OpenClaw were never on it — their sessions showed up everywhere else but contributed to no total, chart or project breakdown. Every agent you enable is now counted, and Cursor gets its own entry in the agent picker."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析功能过去使用手工维护的智能体列表，其中一直没有 Cursor 和 OpenClaw；它们的会话会显示在其他各处，却不会计入总数、图表或项目明细。现在，你启用的每个智能体都会纳入统计，Cursor 也会在智能体选择器中拥有独立条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
