    "Both new agents were added by @thedavidweng against the recipe 5.0 documented — the first real test of that path by someone outside the project. He stewards both formats, and verified each against his own live sessions before this release.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both new agents were added by @thedavidweng against the recipe 5.0 documented — the first real test of that path by someone outside the project. He stewards both formats, and verified each against his own live sessions before this release."
          }
