    "Claude rejected usage requests. Your subscription may be inactive, or Claude may be temporarily rate limiting requests. Tracking will retry automatically; hiding affects only Quota Meter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude rejected usage requests. Your subscription may be inactive, or Claude may be temporarily rate limiting requests. Tracking will retry automatically; hiding affects only Quota Meter."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude 拒绝了用量请求。你的订阅可能未生效，或 Claude 可能暂时限制了请求速率。跟踪功能会自动重试；隐藏操作只影响额度监视器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude sessions running on Anthropic's infrastructure now appear in the pinned Quota Meter beside your local agents, marked Cloud. Switch them on under Settings → Usage Tracking once you have saved a claude.ai cookie.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude sessions running on Anthropic's infrastructure now appear in the pinned Quota Meter beside your local agents, marked Cloud. Switch them on under Settings → Usage Tracking once you have saved a claude.ai cookie."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Anthropic 基础设施上运行的 Claude 会话现在会与本地智能体一起显示在固定的额度监视器中，并标记为“云端”。保存 claude.ai Cookie 后，可在“设置”→“用量跟踪”中启用它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
