    "Cursor, Kimi, Pi and Grok used the first matching binary they found, so an unrelated tool of the same name earlier in your PATH could mask the real one — reporting its version and refusing to resume. Each now looks for the CLI that answers like the CLI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cursor, Kimi, Pi and Grok used the first matching binary they found, so an unrelated tool of the same name earlier in your PATH could mask the real one — reporting its version and refusing to resume. Each now looks for the CLI that answers like the CLI."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cursor、Kimi、Pi 和 Grok 以前会使用找到的第一个同名可执行文件，因此 PATH 中靠前的无关工具可能会遮蔽真正的 CLI，导致显示错误版本并拒绝继续会话。现在，它们都会确认找到的程序确实是对应的 CLI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
