    "Devin keeps every session in one SQLite database (sessions.db) under its CLI data directory. Override only when that data lives outside the default location; point it at the devin data directory or the cli directory that contains sessions.db.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Devin keeps every session in one SQLite database (sessions.db) under its CLI data directory. Override only when that data lives outside the default location; point it at the devin data directory or the cli directory that contains sessions.db."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Devin 将所有会话保存在其 CLI 数据目录下的同一个 SQLite 数据库（sessions.db）中。仅当数据不在默认位置时才需覆盖此设置；请将其指向 devin 数据目录，或包含 sessions.db 的 cli 目录。"
          }
        }
      }
