    "Each agent used to be wired in by hand, surface by surface, so a new one could land in the session list and still be missing from Analytics, the filter pills or search. Every agent is now described once, in its own adapter, and every surface reads that description. Adding an agent dropped from 26 shared-file edits to 12, each one listed in the guide with a test that fails if it's missed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each agent used to be wired in by hand, surface by surface, so a new one could land in the session list and still be missing from Analytics, the filter pills or search. Every agent is now described once, in its own adapter, and every surface reads that description. Adding an agent dropped from 26 shared-file edits to 12, each one listed in the guide with a test that fails if it's missed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "过去，每个智能体都要逐个界面手动接入，因此新智能体即使出现在会话列表中，也可能不会出现在分析、筛选标签或搜索中。现在，每个智能体只需在自己的适配器中描述一次，所有界面都会读取这份描述。添加智能体所需修改的共享文件从 26 个降至 12 个；指南列出了每一项，并通过测试确保不会遗漏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
