    "If your coding agent is missing, there is now a written path to change that — a proposal form, an implementation brief you can hand to your own agent, and a pull-request template. Agents that ship can pick up a steward who keeps their format verified as the CLI moves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If your coding agent is missing, there is now a written path to change that — a proposal form, an implementation brief you can hand to your own agent, and a pull-request template. Agents that ship can pick up a steward who keeps their format verified as the CLI moves."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果缺少你使用的编程智能体，现在已有清晰的支持流程：填写提案表单，将实现说明交给你的智能体，并使用 pull request 模板。已支持的智能体还可以由维护人持续验证，确保 CLI 格式变化后仍可正常使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
