    "Prediction alerts use fresh usage data and fire when the current burn rate can exhaust a 5h or weekly limit within 60 minutes before reset. Recent cached data can still produce low, exhausted, and 5h reset alerts; stale data is ignored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prediction alerts use fresh usage data and fire when the current burn rate can exhaust a 5h or weekly limit within 60 minutes before reset. Recent cached data can still produce low, exhausted, and 5h reset alerts; stale data is ignored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预测提醒使用最新用量数据。当按当前消耗速度计算，5 小时或每周限额会在重置前 60 分钟内耗尽时触发。近期缓存数据仍可触发额度偏低、已耗尽和 5 小时重置提醒；过期数据会被忽略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
