          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs lightweight terminal-based probes in dedicated working folders to refresh usage limits. Probe sessions are auto-generated /usage checks stored in a separate Claude project. Cleanup only removes validated probe sessions; your normal sessions are never touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs lightweight terminal-based probes in dedicated working folders to refresh usage limits. Probe sessions are auto-generated /usage checks stored in a separate Claude project. Cleanup only removes validated probe sessions; your normal sessions are never touched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在专用工作文件夹中运行轻量级终端探测，以刷新用量限额。探测会话是自动生成的 /usage 检查，存储在单独的 Claude 项目中。清理操作只会移除经过验证的探测会话，绝不会影响你的正常会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
