    "The account is signed in, but it does not currently have access to %@ usage. Check the account plan, or hide this provider from Quota Meter while tracking remains enabled.": {
      "comment": "User-visible copy from UsageAuthStatus. Preserve runtime placeholders and allow value reordering for grammar.",
