          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This controls only the standalone Quota Meter. Tracking, the main-window footer, the menu bar, and session indexing are unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This controls only the standalone Quota Meter. Tracking, the main-window footer, the menu bar, and session indexing are unchanged."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设置仅控制独立的额度监视器，不会影响跟踪、主窗口页脚、菜单栏和会话索引。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This feature runs Claude Code headlessly via tmux to fetch `/usage` data (default: every 3 minutes while visible).\n\nRequirements: Claude CLI + tmux installed and authenticated\n\nInstall tmux (via Homebrew):\n  brew install tmux\n\n⚠️ Warnings:\n- Experimental - may fail or cause slowdowns\n- Probing may count toward Claude Code usage limits\n- Disable immediately if you notice performance issues\n- First use requests file access permission (one-time)\n\nPrivacy: Only reads usage percentages, no conversation data accessed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This feature runs Claude Code headlessly via tmux to fetch `/usage` data (default: every 3 minutes while visible).\n\nRequirements: Claude CLI + tmux installed and authenticated\n\nInstall tmux (via Homebrew):\n  brew install tmux\n\n⚠️ Warnings:\n- Experimental - may fail or cause slowdowns\n- Probing may count toward Claude Code usage limits\n- Disable immediately if you notice performance issues\n- First use requests file access permission (one-time)\n\nPrivacy: Only reads usage percentages, no conversation data accessed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此功能通过 tmux 以无界面方式运行 Claude Code，以获取 `/usage` 数据（默认在可见时每 3 分钟一次）。\n\n要求：已安装 Claude CLI 和 tmux，并已完成身份验证\n\n安装 tmux（通过 Homebrew）：\n  brew install tmux\n\n⚠️ 警告：\n- 此功能仍处于实验阶段，可能失败或导致运行缓慢\n- 探测可能计入 Claude Code 用量限制\n- 如果发现性能问题，请立即停用\n- 首次使用时会请求文件访问权限（仅一次）\n\n隐私：仅会读取用量百分比，不会访问对话数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This finds additional matches inside large tool outputs that may not appear in Instant search. Leaving this off keeps search more responsive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This finds additional matches inside large tool outputs that may not appear in Instant search. Leaving this off keeps search more responsive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此功能会在大型工具输出中查找即时搜索可能未显示的更多匹配项。保持关闭可提高搜索响应速度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is an advanced repair action and can be CPU-intensive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an advanced repair action and can be CPU-intensive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是一项高级修复操作，可能会大量占用 CPU。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This rebuild purges cached core index data for all providers (including disabled ones), then rebuilds enabled providers. It can use significant CPU and may reduce responsiveness until complete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This rebuild purges cached core index data for all providers (including disabled ones), then rebuilds enabled providers. It can use significant CPU and may reduce responsiveness until complete."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此次重建会清除所有提供商（包括已停用的提供商）的核心索引缓存数据，然后为已启用的提供商重建索引。此过程可能大量占用 CPU，并在完成前降低响应速度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes all queued crash reports from local storage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes all queued crash reports from local storage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从本地存储中移除所有待处理的崩溃报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will remove %lld sessions from Saved and move their local archive copies to the Trash. Original session files are not deleted.": {
      "comment": "User-visible copy from PinnedSessionsView. Preserve runtime placeholders and allow value reordering for grammar.",
