    "Usage paused — the saved CLI token lapsed. Run any claude command in Terminal to refresh it, or paste a claude.ai session cookie in Settings. Last resort: the probe button in the Quota Meter toolbar (may consume tokens).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usage paused — the saved CLI token lapsed. Run any claude command in Terminal to refresh it, or paste a claude.ai session cookie in Settings. Last resort: the probe button in the Quota Meter toolbar (may consume tokens)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用量跟踪已暂停——保存的 CLI 令牌已失效。请在 Terminal 中运行任意 claude 命令以刷新令牌，或在“设置”中粘贴 claude.ai 会话 Cookie。最后还可使用额度监视器工具栏中的探测按钮（可能消耗令牌）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usage surfaces can stay visible while agents run.": {
