          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the OAuth endpoint keeps failing, Auto mode may fall back to running `claude` in tmux to scrape /usage. Off by default — the interactive CLI can open a browser sign-in. tmux-only mode is unaffected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the OAuth endpoint keeps failing, Auto mode may fall back to running `claude` in tmux to scrape /usage. Off by default — the interactive CLI can open a browser sign-in. tmux-only mode is unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果 OAuth 端点持续失败，自动模式可回退到在 tmux 中运行 `claude` 以抓取 /usage。此功能默认关闭，因为交互式 CLI 可能打开浏览器登录。仅 tmux 模式不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When there are no recent Codex sessions (6+ hours) and the strip or menu bar is visible, ask Codex CLI (/status) via tmux for current usage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
