    "fx writes one directory per session under its sessions root, holding checkpoint.json (the conversation) beside session.json. Override only when that data lives outside the default location; the root may point at the sessions directory or the .fx data directory itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "fx writes one directory per session under its sessions root, holding checkpoint.json (the conversation) beside session.json. Override only when that data lives outside the default location; the root may point at the sessions directory or the .fx data directory itself."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "fx 会在其会话根目录下为每个会话创建一个目录，其中 checkpoint.json（对话）与 session.json 位于同一目录。仅当这些数据不在默认位置时才需要覆盖此设置；根路径可以指向 sessions 目录，也可以指向 .fx 数据目录本身。"
          }
        }
